    <briefdescription>
<para>Assembles the stiffness of a particle from the stiffness it describes node by node: the blocks <formula id="181">$ \boldsymbol{K}_{AB} $</formula> of all nodes (see <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_meshfree_1_1_stiffness_visitor" kindref="compound">StiffnessVisitor</ref>), with addRowsOfNode(), as the particle&apos;s computePhysicsKernels() forms its tangent, without the inertia. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A host uses it through <ref refid="_marmot_particle_stiffness_visitors_8h_1ad37467af1b4bb17a958c394b9b7652e5" kindref="member">assembleStiffness()</ref>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>nDim</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Spatial dimension. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
